Page: WorldMap Data
Cat: 🌍
Function: Provides geospatial market data for 3D globe
Description: Serves continent-sharded company marker data, exchange locations, trade route arcs, and overlay layers (weather, satellites, cats) for the WebGL MiauGlobe and Leaflet WorldMap.
API: GET /api/v1/map/*
Output: GeoJSON markers, arc coordinates, layer configs
